00:14:59,524 --> 00:15:03,584
Over an average remaining lifespan, your cumulative earnings under the Wishonia

296
00:15:03,584 --> 00:15:06,984
path are forty-five times what they'd be on the earth baseline.

297
00:15:07,604 --> 00:15:12,104
The average human gains fifty-two point one million dollars in additional

298
00:15:12,104 --> 00:15:13,204
lifetime income.

299
00:15:13,744 --> 00:15:18,564
On Wishonia, we find it remarkable that "stop wasting money on explosions"

300
00:15:18,564 --> 00:15:20,784
