301
00:15:20,784 --> 00:15:23,484
On your planet, it apparently does.

302
00:15:24,504 --> 00:15:26,144
Here's what that means for your paycheck.

303
00:15:26,804 --> 00:15:31,394
Your species' productivity per person has roughly tripled since nineteen

304
00:15:31,394 --> 00:15:32,164
seventy.

305
00:15:32,164 --> 00:15:36,484
Median wages, adjusted for actual living costs, barely moved.

306
00:15:36,944 --> 00:15:40,884
The gap between what you produce and what you earn went to the items listed

307
00:15:40,884 --> 00:15:41,384
