308
00:15:42,184 --> 00:15:46,164
military budgets, administrative overhead, and a financial system that converts

309
00:15:46,164 --> 00:15:48,684
your productivity into other people's assets.

310
00:15:49,104 --> 00:15:53,504
You subsidized your own impoverishment, which takes talent.

311
00:15:54,524 --> 00:15:58,964
After the treaty, when that gap closes, something strange happens:

