318
00:16:20,304 --> 00:16:25,134
You already live better than the richest human who ever existed before nineteen

319
00:16:25,134 --> 00:16:25,804
hundred.

320
00:16:25,804 --> 00:16:28,464
The peace dividend extends that logic forward:

321
00:16:29,104 --> 00:16:32,984
your great-grandchildren will look at twenty twenty-six billionaires the

322
00:16:32,984 --> 00:16:34,324
