323
00:16:35,104 --> 00:16:36,764
Rich by the standards of their time.

324
00:16:37,364 --> 00:16:39,664
Impoverished by any standard that matters.

325
00:16:40,364 --> 00:16:44,644
On Wishonia, your current billionaires would fall below the poverty line.

326
00:16:45,104 --> 00:16:48,024
