335
00:17:13,724 --> 00:17:16,604
That's compound interest on not being robbed.

336
00:17:17,124 --> 00:17:19,764
On Wishonia, we had the same problem for centuries.

337
00:17:20,284 --> 00:17:24,444
What the treaty did is "stopped the crime and returning the money," which

338
00:17:24,444 --> 00:17:28,644
on your planet is apparently a radical economic proposal rather than the

339
00:17:28,644 --> 00:17:29,604
obvious thing.

340
00:17:30,104 --> 00:17:32,024
The money doesn't trickle down.

341
00:17:32,024 --> 00:17:36,624
("Trickle-down economics" is a phrase your species uses to describe money

342
00:17:36,624 --> 00:17:41,024
that flows upward, which is the most honest mislabeling since "Department

343
00:17:41,024 --> 00:17:41,764
