344
00:17:42,464 --> 00:17:48,024
It flows to every citizen directly as a universal basic income, denominated

345
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:51,604
in wish dollars, deposited daily via smart contract.

346
00:17:52,144 --> 00:17:53,304
No application form.

347
00:17:53,584 --> 00:17:54,704
No means testing.

348
00:17:55,064 --> 00:17:58,904
No bureaucrat deciding whether your poverty is the deserving kind.

349
00:17:59,324 --> 00:18:00,804
The funding mechanism:

350
00:18:01,324 --> 00:18:05,624
a flat transaction tax on all economic activity, collected automatically

351
00:18:05,624 --> 00:18:10,264
