353
00:18:11,824 --> 00:18:14,644
The savings from this alone are staggering.

354
00:18:15,524 --> 00:18:19,484
Your species currently spends five hundred and forty-six billion dollars

355
00:18:19,484 --> 00:18:23,524
per year on the *process* of collecting taxes:

356
00:18:23,524 --> 00:18:29,244
accountants, software, seven point nine billion hours of lost productivity,

357
00:18:29,784 --> 00:18:30,724
and an I.R.S.

358
00:18:30,724 --> 00:18:35,544
that employs tens of thousands of people to do what a smart contract does

359
00:18:35,544 --> 00:18:37,744
at the speed of light for free.

360
00:18:38,644 --> 00:18:40,384
