364
00:18:52,364 --> 00:18:54,684
On Wishonia, a computer does this.

365
00:18:55,063 --> 00:18:57,044
The computer does not need a lawyer.

366
00:18:57,984 --> 00:19:02,924
The computer has never lied about anything, except once, and it apologized.

367
00:19:03,924 --> 00:19:08,644
Then another five hundred and eighty billion dollars per year on regulatory

368
00:19:08,644 --> 00:19:09,464
compliance:

369
00:19:09,844 --> 00:19:13,064
filling out forms to prove you filled out the previous forms.

370
00:19:13,524 --> 00:19:18,164
That's over a trillion dollars per year on the process of *permission.*

371
00:19:18,734 --> 00:19:23,004
Then you spend tens of billions more on the *process* of giving some of

372
00:19:23,004 --> 00:19:23,644
