373
00:19:24,404 --> 00:19:28,944
Social Security Administration, food stamp offices, housing voucher programs,

374
00:19:29,444 --> 00:19:33,964
disability determination centers, each with their own buildings, employees,

375
00:19:34,524 --> 00:19:38,224
forms, appeals processes, and catering budgets.

376
00:19:38,904 --> 00:19:40,584
The flat tax and U.B.I.

377
00:19:40,584 --> 00:19:42,404
eliminate all of it.

378
00:19:42,904 --> 00:19:47,744
Every dollar previously spent processing poverty now goes to eliminating

379
00:19:47,744 --> 00:19:48,324
it.

380
00:19:49,024 --> 00:19:50,324
Total waste in the U.S.

381
00:19:50,324 --> 00:19:50,984
system alone:

382
00:19:50,984 --> 00:19:57,064
four point nine trillion dollars per year, or seventeen percent of G.D.P.

383
00:19:57,824 --> 00:20:03,864
That's the entire economy of Japan being fed into a shredder annually, and

384
00:20:03,864 --> 00:20:07,864
