394
00:20:35,304 --> 00:20:38,104
The money follows the student, not the institution.

395
00:20:38,864 --> 00:20:43,004
Bad schools don't get shut down by a bureaucrat who visited once and filled

396
00:20:43,004 --> 00:20:43,784
