399
00:20:51,584 --> 00:20:52,684
Good schools grow.

400
00:20:53,204 --> 00:20:54,584
Great schools get copied.

401
00:20:55,024 --> 00:20:58,024
The Department of Education goes the way of the I.R.S.:

402
00:20:58,624 --> 00:21:03,024
