458
00:23:54,884 --> 00:23:56,444
Zero villages destroyed.

459
00:23:57,044 --> 00:23:57,864
A personal best.

460
00:23:58,554 --> 00:23:59,544
Their H.R.

461
00:23:59,544 --> 00:24:03,684
department stopped having to euphemize what the company does, which improved

