00:24:08,844 --> 00:24:09,384
Boston Dynamics:

464
00:24:10,564 --> 00:24:11,984
Robots help elderly walk.

465
00:24:12,484 --> 00:24:14,904
The dancing is still cute, now therapeutic.

466
00:24:15,944 --> 00:24:20,444
They finally found a use for the dancing that justifies the billions spent

467
00:24:20,444 --> 00:24:25,204
