470
00:24:31,404 --> 00:24:32,884
Palantir Health Insights:

471
00:24:33,844 --> 00:24:37,084
Data analysis predicts disease outbreaks before they happen.

472
00:24:37,084 --> 00:24:41,084
Privacy-protected, transparent, saves lives.

473
00:24:41,684 --> 00:24:44,364
Still creepy, but helpfully creepy.

474
00:24:44,664 --> 00:24:48,584
Like a doctor who memorizes your schedule and shows up before you know you're

475
00:24:48,584 --> 00:24:49,084
