00:25:45,744 --> 00:25:48,504
Philosophy became our fastest-growing field.

494
00:25:49,064 --> 00:25:50,804
Our philosophers were thrilled.

495
00:25:51,404 --> 00:25:55,544
First time anyone had used "philosophers" and "thrilled" in the same sentence.

