503
00:26:12,024 --> 00:26:14,304
Fixing health fixed everything else.

504
00:26:14,304 --> 00:26:21,324
Like pulling one thread and the whole sweater of human misery unravels. Climate.

505
00:26:21,324 --> 00:26:21,824
Climate change:

506
00:26:22,684 --> 00:26:26,664
