510
00:26:36,224 --> 00:26:41,484
It also helped that you stopped spending fifty billion dollars per year

511
00:26:41,484 --> 00:26:44,824
subsidizing the industry that was causing the problem.

512
00:26:45,764 --> 00:26:50,024
"Fossil fuel subsidy" is a phrase that means "paying someone to set your

513
00:26:50,024 --> 00:26:54,584
